onalProperties, version bump only on removal or retype, map sanitized to metadata before upload.","alternatives":"Shared DB schema; protobuf; no versioning.","why":"Decouples CLI and hosted service and avoids uploading reference answers.","paths":["udebt/contract.py","udebt/remote.py","tests/test_contract.py","tests/test_remote.py"],"centrality":4,"clusters":["C2.1"],"scope":"architectural","history":[{"sha":"12ee384","date":"2026-11-15","klass":"ai","agent":"claude-code","author":"Claude","subject":"Freeze the JSON contract the CLI writes and the hosted side reads (Phase 4a)"},{"sha":"22770de","date":"2026-11-15","klass":"ai","agent":"claude-code","author":"Claude","subject":"Sync with a hosted store over the contract: udebt push and pull (Phase 4a)"}],"importance":0.53,"orientation":{"purpose":"Defines the versioned JSON formats that the CLI writes and the hosted side reads. It validates them, and it pushes and pulls records to the hosted store.","decision":"Schemas allow extra properties. The version bumps only when a field is removed or retyped. The map is cut down to metadata before upload. A shared DB schema, protobuf and no versioning were rejected. The point is to decouple the CLI from the hosted service and keep reference answers from being uploaded.","where":[{"path":"udebt/contract.py","what":"schemas and stdlib validator"},{"path":"udebt/remote.py","what":"push and pull"},{"path":"tests/test_contract.py","what":"contract tests"}],"shaped_by":"[ai] Claude (claude-code) wrote both commits on 2026-11-15.","basis":"9f397fdaacb1","head":"e9c1c8c5754f8f4e9061e4d0316c060bd8d1b788","generated_at":"2026-11-15T11:50:21+00:00"}},{"id":"hosted-analysis","name":"Hosted analysis worker (Render)","kind":"flow","summary":"Analyses a repo in a transient clone and runs an LLM tool loop as a Render service, writing results to Supabase.","decision":"Python worker reusing the CLI code, calling the LLM via messages API, Supabase over REST, GitHub app for webhooks and checks."